# A spell cast as an effect resolves is cast by that effect's permission, whatever the timing (CR 608.2g, 702.85a), so Harbinger of
# the Tides' own flash permission is not what lets it be cast and its {2} is only asked, never owed (CR 601.2b). Over Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt on turn 2 Bot1 casts Shardless Agent for Primal Prayers' {E} (that cast alone may be made as though it had
# flash); its cascade exiles the Harbinger, mana value 2, and casts it without paying its mana cost on Bot2's turn. The flash
# cost is asked and declined: Bot1's one untapped Island, too little to pay {2}, stays untapped, and the Harbinger enters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Primal Prayers
Shardless Agent
Island
Island
Harbinger of the Tides
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Primal Prayers)
Bot2.Choose(Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Energy = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Shardless Agent.Cast(Ability: Pay {E})
? Stack.Count = 3
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Modes(Cast without flash)
? Stack.Count = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Harbinger of the Tides.ManaValue = 2
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

